    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textsLab.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textsCave.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsLab.Array.data[0]'
      value: I wonder what happened here...?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsLab.Array.data[1]'
      value: Wait, this seems important.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsLab.Array.data[2]'
      value: It seems by this book the current state of this forest is a result of
        experimentation...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsLab.Array.data[3]'
      value: Science is both a beautiful and terrible thing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsLab.Array.data[4]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textsTutorial.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textsWasteland.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[0]'
      value: It's been five days since I've fallen in here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[1]'
      value: I suppose that reveals how much the other scientists care about me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[2]'
      value: Ahh, my leg...! It stings!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[3]'
      value: Hm....
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[4]'
      value: Maybe there is something to help this pain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[5]'
      value: I'm not familiar with these plants. They must be invasive!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[6]'
      value: I'm running out of plants and mushrooms to treat my wound, but there's
        still a day's left supply.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[7]'
      value: The best bet I have is mixing them all together in this cauldron.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4312715693941852876, guid: f6336ac4ac8b4d34bc5072418cdc62a0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textsTutorial.Array.data[8]'
